<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>6-Week Shred Protocol</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@400;700;900&family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --orange: #ff5722;
    --orange-mid: #ff572260;
    --orange-dim: #ff572220;
    --bg: #0c0c0f;
    --surface: #14141a;
    --surface2: #1c1c24;
    --border: #2a2a36;
    --text: #e8e8f0;
    --muted: #7a7a90;
    --green: #4caf50;
    --blue: #42a5f5;
    --yellow: #ffc107;
    --purple: #ab47bc;
    --red: #ef5350;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); min-height: 100vh; }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0c0c0f 0%, #1a0a05 50%, #0c0c0f 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 44px 20px 32px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; top: -80px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 700px; height: 340px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, #ff572212 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 4px; color: var(--orange); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .hero-title { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.95; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -1px; }
  .hero-title span { color: var(--orange); }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; }

  /* STATS */
  .stats-strip { display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; background: var(--surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .stat { padding: 13px 20px; text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .stat-val { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--orange); }
  .stat-lbl { font-size: 0.57rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }

  /* ROLLING CYCLE */
  .cycle-wrap { padding: 20px 16px 0; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cycle-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .cycle-day { border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 4px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s; border: 1.5px solid transparent; }
  .cycle-day:hover { filter: brightness(1.15); }
  .cycle-day.active-cyc { border-color: #ffffff50 !important; filter: brightness(1.2); }
  .cd-push { background: #1f1008; border-color: #ff572240; }
  .cd-pull { background: #081520; border-color: #42a5f540; }
  .cd-legs { background: #0d1a0d; border-color: #4caf5040; }
  .cd-rest { background: #151520; border-color: #ab47bc40; }
  .cd-num { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.58rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); }
  .cd-name { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 900; margin-top: 2px; }
  .cd-push .cd-name { color: var(--orange); }
  .cd-pull .cd-name { color: var(--blue); }
  .cd-legs .cd-name { color: var(--green); }
  .cd-rest .cd-name { color: var(--purple); }
  .cd-sub { font-size: 0.54rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; line-height: 1.2; }
  .cycle-note { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; padding: 8px 12px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .cycle-note strong { color: var(--orange); }

  /* TOP NAV */
  .top-nav { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 4px; padding: 14px 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 16px; }
  .top-nav-btn { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 9px 22px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); background: transparent; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s; }
  .top-nav-btn:hover { border-color: var(--orange); color: var(--orange); }
  .top-nav-btn.active { background: var(--orange); border-color: var(--orange); color: #fff; }

  /* SUB NAV */
  .sub-nav { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 4px; padding: 10px 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; background: #0f0f14; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .sub-nav-btn { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); background: transparent; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s; }
  .sub-nav-btn:hover { border-color: var(--orange); color: var(--orange); }
  .sub-nav-btn.active { border-color: var(--orange); color: var(--orange); background: var(--orange-dim); }

  .content { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px; }
  .module { display: none; }
  .module.active { display: block; }
  .submodule { display: none; }
  .submodule.active { display: block; }

  /* DAY TABS */
  .day-tabs { display: flex; gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .day-btn { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); background: var(--surface); color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s; }
  .day-btn.push-btn.active, .day-btn.push-btn:hover { border-color: var(--orange); color: var(--orange); background: #1f1008; }
  .day-btn.pull-btn.active, .day-btn.pull-btn:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); background: #081520; }
  .day-btn.legs-btn.active, .day-btn.legs-btn:hover { border-color: var(--green); color: var(--green); background: #0d1a0d; }
  .day-btn.rest-btn.active, .day-btn.rest-btn:hover { border-color: var(--purple); color: var(--purple); background: #15101a; }
  .day-panel { display: none; }
  .day-panel.active { display: block; }

  /* SESSION HEADER */
  .session-hdr { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 16px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; }
  .session-hdr.push-hdr { border-left: 4px solid var(--orange); }
  .session-hdr.pull-hdr { border-left: 4px solid var(--blue); }
  .session-hdr.legs-hdr { border-left: 4px solid var(--green); }
  .session-hdr.rest-hdr { border-left: 4px solid var(--purple); }
  .badge { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 3px; white-space: nowrap; margin-top: 3px; }
  .badge-push { background: var(--orange); color: #fff; }
  .badge-pull { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; }
  .badge-legs { background: var(--green); color: #fff; }
  .badge-rest { background: var(--purple); color: #fff; }
  .session-name { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
  .session-desc { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 3px; }

  /* SECTION LABEL */
  .slabel { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); margin: 18px 0 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .slabel::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border); }
  .slabel.blue { color: var(--blue); }
  .slabel.green { color: var(--green); }
  .slabel.purple { color: var(--purple); }
  .slabel.yellow { color: var(--yellow); }
  .slabel.red { color: var(--red); }

  /* EXERCISE ROWS */
  .ex-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; padding: 11px 14px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 5px; transition: border-color 0.15s; }
  .ex-row:hover { border-color: #3a3a50; }
  .ex-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--text); }
  .ex-note { font-size: 0.69rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .ex-sets { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--orange); white-space: nowrap; margin-left: 14px; padding-top: 2px; }
  .tag { font-size: 0.57rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; margin-left: 5px; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; }
  .tag-back { background: #ff572215; color: #ff8a65; border: 1px solid #ff572240; }
  .tag-core { background: #42a5f515; color: #90caf9; border: 1px solid #42a5f540; }

  /* CARDIO BLOCK */
  .cardio-block { border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .cb-orange { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface), #1a120a); border: 1px solid var(--orange-mid); }
  .cb-blue { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface), #0a1520); border: 1px solid #42a5f550; }
  .cb-green { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface), #0a1a0a); border: 1px solid #4caf5050; }
  .cb-purple { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface), #150a1a); border: 1px solid #ab47bc50; }
  .cardio-hdr { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .cb-orange .cardio-hdr { color: var(--orange); }
  .cb-blue .cardio-hdr { color: var(--blue); }
  .cb-green .cardio-hdr { color: var(--green); }
  .cb-purple .cardio-hdr { color: var(--purple); }
  .cardio-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.74rem; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2020; color: #ccc; }
  .cardio-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .c-val { font-weight: 700; }
  .cb-orange .c-val { color: #ffab80; }
  .cb-blue .c-val { color: #90caf9; }
  .cb-green .c-val { color: #a5d6a7; }
  .cb-purple .c-val { color: #ce93d8; }

  /* PHASES */
  .phase-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .phase-card { border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; text-align: center; }
  .ph-1 { background: #0a1a0a; border: 1px solid var(--green); }
  .ph-2 { background: #1a100a; border: 1px solid #ff9800; }
  .ph-3 { background: #1a0a0a; border: 1px solid #f44336; }
  .phase-name { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .ph-1 .phase-name { color: var(--green); }
  .ph-2 .phase-name { color: #ff9800; }
  .ph-3 .phase-name { color: #f44336; }
  .phase-wks { font-size: 0.62rem; color: var(--muted); }

  /* PRINCIPLES */
  .principle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .principle { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; font-size: 0.73rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #bbb; }
  .principle strong { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--orange); display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }

  /* NUTRITION */
  .macro-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .macro-card { border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 10px; text-align: center; }
  .mc-cal { background: #1a0e06; border: 1px solid var(--orange-mid); }
  .mc-p { background: #06141f; border: 1px solid #42a5f540; }
  .mc-c { background: #06140a; border: 1px solid #4caf5040; }
  .mc-f { background: #141206; border: 1px solid #ffc10740; }
  .macro-val { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; }
  .mc-cal .macro-val { color: var(--orange); }
  .mc-p .macro-val { color: var(--blue); }
  .mc-c .macro-val { color: var(--green); }
  .mc-f .macro-val { color: var(--yellow); }
  .macro-lbl { font-size: 0.58rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }

  .meal-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
  .meal-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 13px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .meal-time { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.63rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); min-width: 65px; }
  .meal-name { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; flex: 1; }
  .meal-macros { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .macro-pill { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 12px; }
  .mp-cal { background: #ff572215; color: var(--orange); border: 1px solid #ff572240; }
  .mp-p { background: #42a5f515; color: var(--blue); border: 1px solid #42a5f540; }
  .meal-body { padding: 12px 16px; }
  .food-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e28; }
  .food-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .food-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text); }
  .food-note { font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .food-portion { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--green); white-space: nowrap; margin-left: 12px; }

  .portion-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .portion-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 10px; text-align: center; }
  .portion-emoji { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .portion-name { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .portion-desc { font-size: 0.66rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
  .portion-example { font-size: 0.62rem; color: #888; margin-top: 5px; font-style: italic; }

  .dinner-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .dinner-card { background: var(--surface2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 13px; transition: border-color 0.15s; }
  .dinner-card:hover { border-color: var(--green); }
  .dinner-protein { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .dinner-detail { font-size: 0.69rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
  .dinner-macros { display: flex; gap: 7px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .dp { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.63rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 10px; }
  .dp-cal { background: #ff572215; color: var(--orange); border: 1px solid #ff572235; }
  .dp-p { background: #42a5f515; color: var(--blue); border: 1px solid #42a5f535; }

  .rule-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .rule-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 13px; }
  .rule-card strong { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.66rem; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 8px; }
  .rule-card p { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #bbb; line-height: 1.6; }
  .rule-green strong { color: var(--green); border-left: 3px solid var(--green); }
  .rule-orange strong { color: var(--orange); border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); }
  .rule-blue strong { color: var(--blue); border-left: 3px solid var(--blue); }
  .rule-red strong { color: var(--red); border-left: 3px solid var(--red); }
  .rule-yellow strong { color: var(--yellow); border-left: 3px solid var(--yellow); }
  .rule-purple strong { color: var(--purple); border-left: 3px solid var(--purple); }

  .alcohol-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a0e06, #1a1006); border: 1px solid #ffc10740; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .alcohol-hdr { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .drink-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #2a1e08; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #ccc; }
  .drink-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .drink-cal { color: var(--yellow); font-weight: 700; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; }

  .note-box { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 0.74rem; color: #bbb; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .note-box.green { border-left-color: var(--green); }
  .note-box.blue { border-left-color: var(--blue); }
  .note-box strong { color: var(--orange); }
  .note-box.green strong { color: var(--green); }
  .note-box.blue strong { color: var(--blue); }

  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .principle-grid, .rule-grid, .dinner-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .macro-grid, .portion-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
    .stats-strip { flex-direction: column; }
    .stat { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .phase-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cd-sub { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-eyebrow">Science-Based · Rolling PPL · No-Tracking Nutrition</div>
  <div class="hero-title">6-Week <span>Shred</span><br>Protocol</div>
  <div class="hero-sub">193 LBS · 5'11" · ~15–17% BF → ~11% BY MAY 1 · LOWER BACK MODIFIED</div>
</div>

<div class="stats-strip">
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-val">~12 lbs</div><div class="stat-lbl">Fat Target</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-val">~11%</div><div class="stat-lbl">Goal BF%</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-val">2×</div><div class="stat-lbl">Muscle Freq/Wk</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-val">2,150</div><div class="stat-lbl">Train Day Cal</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-val">200g</div><div class="stat-lbl">Protein/Day</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-val">May 1</div><div class="stat-lbl">Target Date</div></div>
</div>

<!-- ROLLING CYCLE -->
<div class="cycle-wrap">
  <div class="slabel" style="margin-top:16px">Rolling 7-Day Cycle — Click Any Day to Jump to That Workout</div>
  <div class="cycle-strip">
    <div class="cycle-day cd-legs active-cyc" onclick="jumpToDay('d3',2)"><div class="cd-num">Start Here</div><div class="cd-name">LEGS A</div><div class="cd-sub">Your Day 1</div></div>
    <div class="cycle-day cd-push" onclick="jumpToDay('d4',3)"><div class="cd-num">Day 2</div><div class="cd-name">PUSH B</div><div class="cd-sub">Shoulders Chest</div></div>
    <div class="cycle-day cd-pull" onclick="jumpToDay('d5',4)"><div class="cd-num">Day 3</div><div class="cd-name">PULL B</div><div class="cd-sub">Back Biceps</div></div>
    <div class="cycle-day cd-legs" onclick="jumpToDay('d6',5)"><div class="cd-num">Day 4</div><div class="cd-name">LEGS B</div><div class="cd-sub">Posterior Chain</div></div>
    <div class="cycle-day cd-rest" onclick="jumpToDay('d7',6)"><div class="cd-num">Day 5</div><div class="cd-name">REST</div><div class="cd-sub">Active Recovery</div></div>
    <div class="cycle-day cd-push" onclick="jumpToDay('d1',0)"><div class="cd-num">Day 6</div><div class="cd-name">PUSH A</div><div class="cd-sub">Chest Shoulders</div></div>
    <div class="cycle-day cd-pull" onclick="jumpToDay('d2',1)"><div class="cd-num">Day 7</div><div class="cd-name">PULL A</div><div class="cd-sub">Back Biceps</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="cycle-note"><strong>Why rolling beats calendar:</strong> Muscle doesn't care what day it is. Rolling guarantees 48–72 hrs between same-muscle sessions — the optimal recovery window — every single time. You hit upper yesterday → Legs A today is your entry point.</div>
</div>

<!-- TOP NAV -->
<div class="top-nav">
  <button class="top-nav-btn active" onclick="showModule('training', this)">🏋️ Training</button>
  <button class="top-nav-btn" onclick="showModule('nutrition', this)">🥗 Nutrition</button>
  <button class="top-nav-btn" onclick="showModule('phases', this)">📈 Phases</button>
  <button class="top-nav-btn" onclick="showModule('cardio', this)">🏃 Cardio</button>
</div>

<div class="content">

  <!-- ═══════════════ TRAINING ═══════════════ -->
  <div class="module active" id="module-training">
